      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786481692843,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "loop self-healing com checkpoint/commit por task\n\nTASK 01\n  ↓\nImplementar\n  ↓\nTestar\n  ↓\nFalhou?\n ├─ NÃO → Checkpoint → Commit\n │                    ↓\n │                  TASK 02\n │\n └─ SIM → Diagnosticar\n          ↓\n        Corrigir\n          ↓\n        Testar novamente\n          ↓\n       ┌──┴──┐\n       │     │\n    passou  falhou\n       │     │\n       ↓     └──→ nova tentativa\n   Checkpoint\n       ↓\n     Commit",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "loop self-healing com checkpoint/commit por task\n\nTASK 01\n  ↓\nImplementar\n  ↓\nTestar\n  ↓\nFalhou?\n ├─ NÃO → Checkpoint → Commit\n │                    ↓\n │                  TASK 02\n │\n └─ SIM → Diagnosticar\n          ↓\n        Corrigir\n          ↓\n        Testar novamente\n          ↓\n       ┌──┴──┐\n       │     │\n    passou  falhou\n       │     │\n       ↓     └──→ nova tentativa\n   Checkpoint\n       ↓\n     Commit",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
